* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
* RDELRC-N - Delete Contents-Pointer of a given active Report
*
* Maintenance
* uuu     yyyy-mm-dd s(999999) Description
* xsiszha 2000-08-01 (CE7461)  Extend Report and Bundle Names
* sju     2004-12-10 NOM31     Adacalls exceeded under Complete
* xsetggr 2007-05-02 NOM3201   change rnb to P11
* fhi     2011-05-02 NOMALL-901 Log any online delete operation
* fhi     2016-04-15 NOMALL-1837 Introduce +DEVICE for testing
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
DEFINE DATA PARAMETER
1  P-REPNAME                 (A25)
1  P-REPRNB                  (P11)
************************************************************************
INDEPENDENT
1 +DEVICE              (A8)
************************************************************************
LOCAL USING SUPER-L
LOCAL
1 REPORT-CONTENTS VIEW OF NRM-REPORT-CONTENTS
  2 AC-REPNAME
  2 AC-REPRNB
*
1 #COUNTER       (P3) INIT <50>
1 #SCREEN-COUNT  (I2)
1 #SCREEN-LIMIT  (I2)   CONST <500>
1 #OBJ           (A50)
*
END-DEFINE
*
MOVE P-REPNAME TO #AC-REPNAME
MOVE P-REPRNB  TO #AC-REPRNB
RESET #AC-SEQ
*
REARC. READ REPORT-CONTENTS BY AC-REP-RNB-SEQ = #AC-REP-RNB-SEQ
  IF AC-REPNAME NE #AC-REPNAME OR AC-REPRNB  NE #AC-REPRNB
    ESCAPE BOTTOM (REARC.)
  END-IF
  IF +DEVICE NE 'BATCH'
    ADD 1 TO #SCREEN-COUNT
    IF #SCREEN-COUNT GE #SCREEN-LIMIT
      RESET #SCREEN-COUNT
      CALLNAT 'SHWORK-N'
    END-IF
  END-IF
  DELETE (REARC.)
  COMPRESS #AC-REPNAME '/' #AC-REPRNB TO #OBJ LEAVING NO
  PERFORM RMLOGDEL #OBJ 'RP-CONTENTS'
  IF *COUNTER > #COUNTER
    RESET *COUNTER
    END OF TRANSACTION
  END-IF
END-READ
END TRANSACTION
*
END
